---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="找不到頁面" description="請從首頁或案例列表繼續瀏覽張瑋麟中醫師的網站。" noindex>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap wrap-narrow not-found">
      <p class="section__eyebrow">404</p>
      <h1>找不到這個頁面</h1>
      <p>這個連結可能已更新，請從首頁或案例列表繼續瀏覽。</p>
      <a href="/" class="hero__btn">回到首頁</a>
      <a href="/cases/" class="view-all">查看治療案例</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .not-found { text-align: center; padding-block: 3rem; }
  h1 { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .view-all { display: block; }
</style>
